00:46:31,972 --> 00:46:41,472
実はね、キービジュアルで、先ちょたちもつけてるのでお揃いにしちゃってください。まりんなにかすごい、すごい力持ってる、あすら。
Actually, the key visual shows the Captain and everyone wearing them too, so please match with us! Marine has some kind of amazing, powerful aura...

361
00:46:41,472 --> 00:47:07,572
そして最後はこちら！ブロマイドケース！こちらなんと、ご購入いただいた方には、キービジュアルのブロマイドと我々4人の手書きメッセージが書かれたメッセージもついてきます！
And finally, this! The bromide case! This one, amazingly, comes with a key visual bromide and a message card featuring handwritten messages from all four of us!

362
00:47:07,572 --> 00:47:09,072
以上です！
That's all!

363
00:47:09,072 --> 00:47:14,572
今回はフルセット販売はないので、欲しいものをそれぞれ単品購入していただく形になります。
This time there is no full set sale, so you'll need to purchase the items you want individually.

364
00:47:14,572 --> 00:47:19,372
数量限定もないので、皆さんよく吟味して選んでくださいね！お願いします！
There's no quantity limit either, so please consider carefully and choose! Please!

365
00:47:19,372 --> 00:47:31,572
ということで、まりだくさんのグッズ紹介でした！詳細はグッズ販売ページなどからご確認ください！お願いします！
And that's it for the packed merchandise introduction! Please check the merchandise sales page for details! Please!

366
00:47:31,572 --> 00:47:42,572
では、告知も終わったところでライブは終盤に入っております！改めて、今までの5周年と今後6周年に向けて一言ずつもらえればと思います。
Now, with the announcements finished, the live is entering its final stretch! I'd like to hear a few words from everyone looking back at our 5th anniversary and toward our 6th year.

367
00:47:42,572 --> 00:47:47,372
じゃあ、喋りたい人。健康で！楽しく！有意義に！
So, whoever wants to speak. Healthy! Fun! Meaningful!

368
00:47:47,372 --> 00:47:56,572
会社のルールを守って！怒られないように！
Follow the company rules! So you don't get yelled at!

369
00:47:56,572 --> 00:48:03,572
せーの！ホロライブ！ファンタジー！
Ready, set! Hololive! Fantasy!

370
00:48:03,572 --> 00:48:13,572
ファンタジー！次の衣装もよろしくお願いします！
Fantasy! Please look forward to our next outfit too!

371
00:48:13,572 --> 00:48:22,072
まだまだライブは続くのでお楽しみに！えーい！
The live still continues, so look forward to it! Yay!

372
00:48:54,072 --> 00:49:02,072
[Title: 打上花火]あの日見渡した渚を 今も思い出すんだ
[Title: Uchiage Hanabi] That beach we looked out over on that day, I still remember it now

373
00:49:03,072 --> 00:49:12,572
砂の上に刻んだ言葉 君の後ろ姿
The words carved into the sand, and your retreating figure

374
00:49:14,072 --> 00:49:26,072
寄り返す波が 足元をよぎり何かを攫う 夕凪の中 日暮れだけが通り過ぎて行く
The returning waves brush against our feet, carrying something away; in the evening calm, only twilight passes by

375
00:49:34,072 --> 00:49:42,572
パッと光って咲いた 花火を見ていた きっとまだ 終わらない夏が
We watched the fireworks flash and bloom brightly; surely, an endless summer

376
00:49:44,072 --> 00:49:52,572
曖昧な心を 解かして繋いだ この夜が 続いて欲しかった
Dissolving and connecting our vague hearts, I wanted this night to go on

377
00:50:05,167 --> 00:50:09,107
あと何度君と同じ花火を見られるかなって
Wondering how many more times we can watch the same fireworks together...

378
00:50:09,197 --> 00:50:12,687
笑う顔に何ができるだろうか
What can I do when I see your smiling face?

379
00:50:14,297 --> 00:50:16,977
傷つくこと 喜ぶこと
Getting hurt, feeling joy—

380
00:50:17,077 --> 00:50:19,517
繰り返す波と情動
repeating waves and emotions,

381
00:50:19,617 --> 00:50:23,317
焦燥 最終列車の音
impatience, and the sound of the final train.

382
00:50:24,557 --> 00:50:29,437
何度でも言葉にして君を呼ぶよ 波間を選び
No matter how many times, I'll put it into words and call you, choosing the gaps in the waves

383
00:50:29,657 --> 00:50:33,457
もう一度
once more.

384
00:50:34,287 --> 00:50:40,037
もう二度と悲しまずに済むように
So that we never have to experience sadness again,

385
00:50:40,137 --> 00:50:42,587
済むように 進むように
so that we can move forward...

386
00:50:51,357 --> 00:50:56,317
ハッと息を呑めば 消えちゃいそうな光が
If I hold my breath, a light that might fade away

387
00:50:56,417 --> 00:51:00,167
きっとまだ胸に住んでいた
was surely still living in my chest.

388
00:51:01,157 --> 00:51:05,897
手を伸ばせば触れた あったかい未来は
If I reached out, I could touch a warm future

389
00:51:05,997 --> 00:51:10,137
ひそかに二人を見ていた
that was secretly watching over the two of us.

390
00:51:12,437 --> 00:51:16,717
パッと花火が夜に咲いた 夜に咲いて
Fireworks suddenly bloomed in the night, blooming in the night

391
00:51:16,817 --> 00:51:20,657
静かに消えた 静かに消えた
and fading away quietly.

392
00:51:20,957 --> 00:51:24,577
離さないで 離さないで
Don't let go, don't let go,

393
00:51:24,857 --> 00:51:30,597
もう少しだけ もう少しだけ このままで
just a little more, just a little more, stay just like this.

394
00:51:41,497 --> 00:51:49,157
あの日見渡した渚を 今も思い出すんだ
The shore I looked out at that day, I still remember it now.

395
00:51:51,097 --> 00:51:54,757
砂の上に刻んだ言葉
Words carved upon the sand,

396
00:51:54,857 --> 00:51:59,617
君の後ろ姿
and your silhouette from behind.

397
00:52:01,857 --> 00:52:05,597
パッと光って咲いた 花火を見ていた
We were watching the fireworks flash and bloom;

398
00:52:05,897 --> 00:52:10,597
きっとまだ終わらない夏が
surely a summer that never ends...

399
00:52:11,257 --> 00:52:16,117
曖昧な心を 解かして繋いだ
Melting and connecting our ambiguous hearts,

400
00:52:16,217 --> 00:52:20,557
この夜が続いて欲しかった
I wanted this night to go on.

401
00:52:32,197 --> 00:53:00,957
ラララララ…
La la la la la...

402
00:53:57,180 --> 00:54:00,580
[Title: 新宝島]
[Title: New Treasure Island]

403
00:53:57,180 --> 00:54:00,580
[Text: 作詞・作曲:山口一郎]
[Text: Lyrics & Music: Ichiro Yamaguchi]

404
00:54:06,457 --> 00:54:08,617
次と その次と
Next, and the next,

405
00:54:08,897 --> 00:54:17,397
その次と線を引き続けた
and the next, I kept drawing lines...

406
00:54:19,097 --> 00:54:21,377
次の 目的地を
Our next destination,

407
00:54:21,957 --> 00:54:27,617
目的地を描くんだ 宝島
drawing out our destination, the treasure island.

408
00:54:29,437 --> 00:54:36,670
おー！このまま君を連れて行くよ
Oh! I'll take you away just like this,

409
00:54:37,170 --> 00:54:42,390
丁寧に 丁寧に 丁寧に描くと
drawing it carefully, carefully, carefully,

410
00:54:43,410 --> 00:54:49,790
揺れたり 震えたりした線で 丁寧 丁寧 丁寧に描くと
with lines that swayed and trembled, carefully, carefully, carefully...

411
00:54:51,990 --> 00:54:55,790
決めていたよ
I had decided to do so.

412
00:55:07,538 --> 00:55:12,188
次も その次も その次も
Next time, and the time after that, and after that...

413
00:55:12,838 --> 00:55:16,938
まだ目的地じゃない
We haven't reached our destination yet.

414
00:55:18,888 --> 00:55:24,288
夢の景色を 景色を探すんだ
Searching for the scenery of our dreams,

415
00:55:25,188 --> 00:55:29,088
宝島
Treasure Island.

416
00:55:30,288 --> 00:55:37,488
このまま君を連れて行くと
If we take you along just like this,

417
00:55:37,688 --> 00:55:43,888
丁寧 丁寧 丁寧に描くと
drawing carefully, carefully, carefully,

418
00:55:44,088 --> 00:55:50,088
揺れたり震えたりした線で
with lines that tremble and shake,

419
00:55:50,088 --> 00:55:56,588
丁寧 丁寧 丁寧に描くと 決めていたよ
we decided to draw them carefully, carefully, carefully...

420
00:56:45,088 --> 00:56:53,588
このまま君を連れて行くよ
We'll take you along just like this,

421
00:56:53,588 --> 00:57:01,588
丁寧 丁寧 丁寧に描くよ
drawing carefully, carefully, carefully,

422
00:57:01,588 --> 00:57:09,088
揺れたり震えたりしたって
even if they tremble and shake,

423
00:57:09,088 --> 00:57:15,588
丁寧 丁寧 丁寧に歌うよ
we'لل sing carefully, carefully, carefully,

424
00:57:15,588 --> 00:57:22,088
それでも君を連れて行くよ
even so, we'll take you along,

425
00:57:22,088 --> 00:57:28,088
揺れたり震えたりした線で
with lines that tremble and shake,

426
00:57:28,088 --> 00:57:36,088
描くよ 君の歌を
we'll draw your song.

427
00:58:37,088 --> 00:59:08,224
[Title: Square of Magic!]

